+/**
+ * dpaa2_io_create() - create a dpaa2_io object.
+ * @desc: the dpaa2_io descriptor
+ * @dev: the actual DPIO device
+ *
+ * Activates a "struct dpaa2_io" corresponding to the given config of an actual
+ * DPIO object.
